{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Comfy.ComfyUI-Desktop","latestVersion":"1.1.9","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"© 2026 Comfy Org","description":"A desktop app for ComfyUI, the most powerful and modular diffusion model GUI, api and backend with a graph/nodes interface","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"User Guide","DocumentUrl":"https://comfyorg.notion.site/"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"© 2026 Comfy Org","description":"A desktop app for ComfyUI, the most powerful and modular diffusion model GUI, api and backend with a graph/nodes interface","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"User Guide","DocumentUrl":"https://comfyorg.notion.site/"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"ComfyUI Desktop is a packaged way to use ComfyUI and comes bundled with a few things:\n- Stable version of ComfyUI from releases\n- ComfyUI_frontend\n- ComfyUI-Manager\n- uv\nOn startup, it will install all the necessary python dependencies with uv and start the ComfyUI server. The app will automatically update with stable releases of ComfyUI, ComfyUI-Manager, and the uv executable as well as some desktop specific features.","moniker":"comfyui","name":"ComfyUI","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop","publisher":"Comfy Org","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop/issues","publisherUrl":"https://comfy.org/","releaseNotes":"Comfy Desktop 1.1.9. This promotes 1.1.9-rc.5 to stable. Changes since 1.1.8:\nComfy Agent\n- Agent downloads no longer hold up launch. Desktop downloads the agent's packages in the background and uses them on the next launch, instead of making you wait. (#1787, #1791)\n- The agent stays usable when an update can't be applied. Desktop keeps the agent you already have, and the matching ComfyUI frontend with it, so the Agent button doesn't disappear. (#1800, #1901)\n- Agent updates can move an installed package up when the new agent needs a newer version, instead of failing. (#1793)\n- Agent run events and status values are now reported correctly. (#1799, #1806, #1808, #1890)\nFixes\n- Install wizard: the starter-template step no longer gets stuck after scrolling Configure, and Configure no longer scrolls into empty space below the form. (#1898, #1930)\n- Linux .deb: declares libasound2 and libgbm1, so installs on minimal Debian and Ubuntu systems get the libraries they need. (#1797)\n- Updates: a clear error when an install has no origin to update from, and no more endless refreshing of the installs list while offline. (#1796, #1794)\n- Settings: changing settings from a placeholder screen no longer launches ComfyUI or reopens onboarding. (#1730)\n- Accounts: a sign-in applies to the next ComfyUI launch without restarting Desktop, and opening a new instance that was never signed in no longer resets your account status. (#1781, #1784)\n- Each launch gets its own session folder, even when two start in the same millisecond. (#1790)\n- The unused agent connection (MCP) button is removed from the sidebar. (#1747)\nKnown limitation\n- Where pypi.org is unreachable, installs can be slow or fail even with a PyPI mirror set, as in 1.1.8. A fix is planned for 1.1.10.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/Comfy-Desktop/releases/tag/v1.1.9","tags":["comfyui","diffusion"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"ComfyUI 的桌面应用程序。ComfyUI 是一款强大的模块化扩散模型 GUI、API 和后台，具有图形/节点界面","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"用户手册","DocumentUrl":"https://comfyorg.notion.site/"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"ComfyUI Desktop 打包了 ComfyUI，包含：\n- 取自 releases 的稳定版 ComfyUI\n- ComfyUI_frontend\n- ComfyUI-Manager\n- uv\n软件在启动时会用 uv 安装所有必要的 Python 依赖项，并启动 ComfyUI 服务器。应用程序会自动更新 ComfyUI、ComfyUI-Manager 和 uv 可执行文件的稳定版本，以及一些桌面特定功能。"}},"longDescription":"ComfyUI Desktop is a packaged way to use ComfyUI and comes bundled with a few things:\n- Stable version of ComfyUI from releases\n- ComfyUI_frontend\n- ComfyUI-Manager\n- uv\nOn startup, it will install all the necessary python dependencies with uv and start the ComfyUI server. The app will automatically update with stable releases of ComfyUI, ComfyUI-Manager, and the uv executable as well as some desktop specific features.","moniker":"comfyui","name":"ComfyUI","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop","publisher":"Comfy Org","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/desktop/issues","publisherUrl":"https://comfy.org/","releaseNotes":"Comfy Desktop 1.1.9. This promotes 1.1.9-rc.5 to stable. Changes since 1.1.8:\nComfy Agent\n- Agent downloads no longer hold up launch. Desktop downloads the agent's packages in the background and uses them on the next launch, instead of making you wait. (#1787, #1791)\n- The agent stays usable when an update can't be applied. Desktop keeps the agent you already have, and the matching ComfyUI frontend with it, so the Agent button doesn't disappear. (#1800, #1901)\n- Agent updates can move an installed package up when the new agent needs a newer version, instead of failing. (#1793)\n- Agent run events and status values are now reported correctly. (#1799, #1806, #1808, #1890)\nFixes\n- Install wizard: the starter-template step no longer gets stuck after scrolling Configure, and Configure no longer scrolls into empty space below the form. (#1898, #1930)\n- Linux .deb: declares libasound2 and libgbm1, so installs on minimal Debian and Ubuntu systems get the libraries they need. (#1797)\n- Updates: a clear error when an install has no origin to update from, and no more endless refreshing of the installs list while offline. (#1796, #1794)\n- Settings: changing settings from a placeholder screen no longer launches ComfyUI or reopens onboarding. (#1730)\n- Accounts: a sign-in applies to the next ComfyUI launch without restarting Desktop, and opening a new instance that was never signed in no longer resets your account status. (#1781, #1784)\n- Each launch gets its own session folder, even when two start in the same millisecond. (#1790)\n- The unused agent connection (MCP) button is removed from the sidebar. (#1747)\nKnown limitation\n- Where pypi.org is unreachable, installs can be slow or fail even with a PyPI mirror set, as in 1.1.8. A fix is planned for 1.1.10.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/Comfy-Desktop/releases/tag/v1.1.9","tags":["comfyui","diffusion"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.9/app.json","detailSha256":"6ce7242e2fd399aac49139e8b677d8c0086e1f3b633e015dfa334bc5085a1141","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.1.9"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.8/app.json","detailSha256":"7604f8f4c80a99ac6ce5249119b0ec699104903a88bed2edc9c8115df9e2cb75","releaseDate":"2026-10-22","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.1.8"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.7/app.json","detailSha256":"21f5b14cf64e0f614020702d2daef152da5fef3dc607f9a295088ce785430e28","releaseDate":"2026-10-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.1.7"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.6/app.json","detailSha256":"28251c0090479dbfd38ecbfe16c52ae0748dc7112555d0acac330cbfd63f6acb","releaseDate":"2026-10-03","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.1.6"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.5/app.json","detailSha256":"d4c341749e218cf294c04fc09575f70012ab7d6cc4eb95bcb8ae7ba89723ca41","releaseDate":"2026-10-02","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.1.5"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.4/app.json","detailSha256":"4a8ce71bda30531a2427ed2f3fc478666a09c84a36d0418f4d20737b597fc0ea","releaseDate":"2026-09-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.1.4"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.3/app.json","detailSha256":"3d2fcc63d153fc8f4e64b19634f9515c0e12b785